Third-party components
----------------------

src/supermimic/, tests/, scripts/ (training core)
  Imported from https://github.com/YanYuan98/Supermimic_mod
  at commit 6932f1cd33532b4e84ff173df926d8195a58c45a, itself a fork of
  https://github.com/CuboiLeo/SuperMimic-Reproduced.
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Yuxi Liu. Full text: LICENSES/MIT-Supermimic_mod.txt.
  Substantially modified since the import (sampler, world-model state frame, clip-end handling,
  goal layouts, deployment, evaluation).

deploy/sonic/patches/
  Patches to NVIDIA GR00T-WholeBodyControl (SONIC), https://github.com/NVlabs/GR00T-WholeBodyControl,
  Apache License 2.0. The patches modify that project's files and are distributed under its licence.
  SONIC's release policy and planner weights are not included; they are downloaded from NVIDIA under
  the NVIDIA Open Model License.

site/vendor/
  Third-party libraries fetched by tools/fetch_site_vendor.sh (three.js, MIT; MuJoCo WebAssembly,
  Apache-2.0; ONNX Runtime Web, MIT). Versions and licence texts: site/vendor/README.md.

site/assets/gpu/rtx4090.glb (3D model of the GPU on the project page)
  "GeForce RTX 4090 Founders Edition" by exéla (https://skfb.ly/oyBLN), CC BY-NC 4.0, modified (lettering
  painted out, label turned upright, compressed). Not covered by this repository's Apache-2.0 licence.
  NVIDIA, GeForce and RTX are trademarks of NVIDIA Corporation; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed
  by NVIDIA.

site/assets/motions/ (demo motions)
  Retargeted from the CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture Database (mocap.cs.cmu.edu; created with funding from NSF
  EIA-0196217) and the 100STYLE dataset (Ian Mason, Sebastian Starke, Taku Komura; CC BY 4.0). Per-clip sources:
  site/assets/motions/index.json.

Released model weights (Hugging Face, kevinhenryz/realmimic): CC BY-NC 4.0, not Apache-2.0. Training data includes
Motion Data by Bones Studio (https://bones.studio/); use of the underlying dataset is subject to the BONES Motion
Capture Dataset License Agreement.

Method: SuperMimic (Q. Liao et al., CoRL 2026, arXiv:2610.28480). realmimic is an independent,
unofficial implementation and is not affiliated with the authors.
